3","summary":"The central bank lifted its overnight rate a quarter point to 2.5%, citing energy costs tied to the Middle East conflict. Inflation was 3.1% in September and is expected to near 3.5% by year-end; further hikes are possible.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12123982/bank-of-canada-interest-rates-october-2026/","published":"2026-10-28","id":"n2"},{"cat":"World","title":"Israel election count: Netanyahu bloc 53 seats, short of majority","summary":"With most votes counted, Netanyahu's bloc has about 53 of 120 seats versus 48 for Gadi Eisenkot's bloc and 19 for Arab parties. Over 400,000 special ballots, many from soldiers, are still being counted, and a caretaker government may persist.","source":"Ynetnews","url":"https://www.ynetnews.com/article/hjnatbkaml","published":"2026-10-28","id":"n3"},{"cat":"Business","title":"Fed holds rates at 3.75%-4% as two officials push for a hike","summary":"The Federal Reserve kept its benchmark range unchanged in a 10-2 vote, with Lisa Cook and Beth Hammack favouring another quarter-point increase. U.S. consumer prices rose 3.7% year over year in September.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/28/fed-holds-rates-days-before-us-midterms-as-two-officials-push-for-another-hike","published":"2026-10-28","id":"n4"},{"cat":"Business","title":"Alphabet slides after earnings; S&P 500 and Nasdaq close up 0.3%","summary":"U.S. stocks edged higher Wednesday (S&P 500 +0.3%, Dow +0.2%, Nasdaq +0.3%). Alphabet fell about 8-10% after hours despite 25% revenue growth to $127.6B as search growth slowed, while Microsoft rose nearly 3%.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/29/shares-and-us-futures-mixed-after-google-parent-alphabets-earnings-disappoint","published":"2026-10-29","id":"n5"},{"cat":"World","title":"Flavio Bolsonaro arrives in U.S. after fleeing Brazil","summary":"Brazil's defeated presidential candidate reached the Miami area after Sunday's runoff loss to Lula, reportedly defying a court travel ban. He is under investigation for alleged corruption and money laundering; the U.S. says it will grant his family visas.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/28/us-to-grant-flavio-bolsonaro-visa-as-he-flees-brazil-and-makes-brief-stop-in-ecuador-via-a","published":"2026-10-28","id":"n6"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Carney says no U.S. trade deal likely before Nov. 3 midterms","summary":"PM Mark Carney said Canada is 'not at that position right now' on a deal with Washington, though sources say political-level talks have restarted. U.S. 50% tariffs and Canadian counter-tariffs remain in place since talks collapsed in August.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12124110/mark-carney-trade-deal-not-right-now-us-midterms/","published":"2026-10-28","id":"n7"},{"cat":"AI","title":"Microsoft booked $10 billion from OpenAI in a single quarter","summary":"Microsoft's filing shows OpenAI-related revenue of $10B, nearly 11% of its $92.3B quarterly total, a pace near $40B a year. Receivables owed by OpenAI rose to $7.2B and Microsoft's stake slipped to about 24%.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/28/microsoft-recorded-10-billion-in-revenue-from-openai/","published":"2026-10-28","id":"n8"},{"cat":"Business","title":"European gas tops €100/MWh for first time since 2022","summary":"The Dutch TTF benchmark rose over 4% to about €100.37, up from roughly €32 before the Iran war began in February. EU storage is 75% full versus a 90% target, and the EU energy commissioner warned of another energy crisis.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/28/european-gas-price-crosses-100-for-first-time-since-2022-as-eu-warns-of-new-crisis","published":"2026-10-28","id":"n9"},{"cat":"Major","title":"U.S. measles cases top 4,500, about double last year","summary":"The U.S. has reported more than 4,500 measles cases this year and risks losing its measles-free status. A JAMA forecast warns the disease could become endemic again without higher vaccination rates.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/29/us-measles-surge-reminds-of-europes-vaccination-gaps","published":"2026-10-29","id":"n10"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Canada's big banks block personal AI agents from online banking","summary":"TD, RBC and BMO have barred third-party AI agents from authenticated banking, while Scotiabank and CIBC are limiting or discouraging them. Banks cite agents acting beyond user instructions and customers sharing login credentials.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12124433/ai-agents-canadian-banks/","published":"2026-10-28","id":"n11"},{"cat":"Business","title":"Volkswagen posts €5.8 billion quarterly loss","summary":"VW's third-quarter loss widened from €1.1B a year earlier as sales fell 6.3% to €75.3B amid EV costs and Chinese competition. The group plans to cut 120,000 jobs by 2030.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/29/volkswagen-posts-58-billion-loss-as-chinese-competition-bites","published":"2026-10-29","id":"n12"},{"cat":"AI","title":"Anthropic launches tools showing what enterprise AI spend delivers","summary":"New reports let managers see what teams produced with Claude, what it cost and where workflows broke down, plus pooled token budgets. A Jellyfish study found Anthropic-model tools behind nearly a third of proposed code changes.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/28/anthropic-just-launched-tools-to-show-companies-what-their-ai-spending-is-buying/","published":"2026-10-28","id":"n13"},{"cat":"Major","title":"Trump moves to ease methane limits on oil and gas producers","summary":"Trump announced plans to roll back Biden-era methane emission rules, which the EPA says will save $45B. Methane accounts for roughly a third of warming since pre-industrial times.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/28/trump-rolls-back-methane-rules-for-us-oil-and-gas-industry","published":"2026-10-28","id":"n14"},{"cat":"World","title":"Serbian police kill knife attacker outside Israeli embassy","summary":"A minor who attacked a police guard with two knives in Belgrade was shot dead; the officer was lightly hurt. Serbia raised its terror alert to the highest level and is probing a suspected Islamic State-inspired attack.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/28/serbian-police-kill-attacker-outside-israeli-embassy-in-suspected-terrorist-attack","published":"2026-10-28","id":"n15"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Commons keeps B.C. oil tanker ban, defeating Conservative bill","summary":"MPs voted along party lines at second reading, with only Conservatives backing repeal of the Oil Tanker Moratorium Act. The law bars large crude tankers off B.C.'s northern coast.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12124867/bc-tanker-ban-conservatives-bill-defeated/","published":"2026-10-28","id":"n16"},{"cat":"AI","title":"Google takes AI Mode search ads global as search growth slows","summary":"Google is bringing ads in AI Mode to international markets after Search revenue growth slowed to 12%. Google Cloud revenue more than doubled to $30.7B in the quarter.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/28/google-expands-ai-search-ads-globally-as-core-ad-growth-slows/","published":"2026-10-28","id":"n17"},{"cat":"Major","title":"Meta and Snap face new jury trial over alleged harm to teens","summary":"Jury selection began in Los Angeles in a consolidated case; TikTok and YouTube settled before trial. Opening statements are set for Nov. 4, with Zuckerberg and Spiegel expected to testify.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/28/social-media-on-trial-again-meta-and-snap-face-jury-over-alleged-harm-to-teens","published":"2026-10-28","id":"n18"},{"cat":"AI","title":"Nvidia releases open Nemotron transcription model for 40 languages","summary":"Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe is a free, open-weight 30B-parameter speech-to-text model that handles hour-long recordings and up to eight speakers. Nvidia also released version 2 of its Granary speech dataset.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/28/voice-ai-in-vogue-nvidia-releases-new-open-transcription-model/","published":"2026-10-28","id":"n19"}]}